# Security

See `docs/SECURITY.md`.

## MUST

- Keep secrets out of git; use `.env.example` for bastion docs only
- Log request metadata only (no message bodies / full events)
- Keep CORS allowlisted; OPTIONS via Lambda
- Justify IAM and invoke SourceArn changes

## MUST NOT

- Hardcode API keys
- Set `Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *`
- Return sensitive error details to clients
